      # encrypted with the draft until it is sent, rejected, expired or deleted. Nothing is sent
      # until POST /inboxes/{inbox_id}/drafts/{draft_id}/send, or until `send_at` (BillionSend
      # extension) when it is given: the draft is then sent as the caller at that time, through
      # every rule and limit, and must have a recipient. With `send_at`, a reply draft for an email
      # that already has one answers 409 instead of the existing draft.
